    "problem_statement": "The MeshCoP Steering Data (bloom filter) object cannot report an error when asked to initialize with an invalid length or update an empty/invalid filter. Initializing with a length of zero or a length greater than the maximum, or updating the bloom filter of a steering data whose length is not valid, must be rejected with an error status instead of silently succeeding or asserting. The public steering-data APIs need an init/length-validation contract that returns an error for out-of-range lengths.",
